@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title SVG CLI - complete CLI and SVG IO (part 2)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "src/bootstrap" as Bootstrap {
  component "main.ts\ncurrent composition root" as Main
}
package "src/cli" as CLI {
  component "CliShell / Tokenizer\nstdin, stdout, stderr" as Shell
}
package "src/application" as Application {
  component "CommandDispatcher / ArgumentParser\nEditCommand: Create / Move / Scale / Set / Delete\nGroup / Ungroup / AddTo / Front / Back\nCommand: Init / Read / Save / Canvas\nTree / Show / Help / Undo / Redo" as Commands
  component "EditorSession\nprepare document + history -> replace state" as Session
  component "HistoryManager / HistoryEntry\nprivate before + after snapshots\nnew stacks on each transition" as History
  component "DocumentView / TextPresenter\nimmutable values -> output lines" as Presentation
  component "DocumentStore / SvgCodec\napplication-owned ports" as Ports
}
package "src/domain (implemented)" as Domain {
  component "SvgDocument / TreeNode\nShape / GeometricShape / Geometry\nRect / Circle / Ellipse / Line / Text / Group\nShapeFactory (constructors + parameter metadata)\nShapeDescription / Validation / DomainError" as Model
}
package "src/infrastructure" as Infrastructure {
  component "FileDocumentStore (atomic replacement)\nXmlSvgCodec (saxes parser)" as Adapters
}
package "tests" as Tests {
  component "Domain / tokenizer / commands / session\nHistory failure injection and isolation\nCLI smoke tests and script replay" as Checks
}

Main --> Shell : constructs
Main --> Commands : constructs
Main --> Session : constructs
Main --> Model : constructs factory
Main --> Adapters : constructs and injects
Shell --> Commands : tokens / results
Commands --> Session : use cases
Commands --> Presentation : query formatting
Session --> Model : behavior / clone / descriptions
Session --> History : prepare history transition
History --> Model : independent snapshot clones
Commands --> Model : neutral parameter metadata
Adapters ..|> Ports : implements
Session --> Ports : read / encode / write
Infrastructure --> Domain : factory / neutral elements
Checks --> Model : verified behavior
Checks --> Commands : parsing / atomicity
Checks --> Main : starts child process

note bottom of Domain
  No dependency on outer packages, Node IO or XML.
  Polymorphic geometry; ordered Composite tree.
  Only SvgDocument exposes structure mutation.
  clone() preserves instances, links and ID index.
end note
note bottom of Commands
  Implemented: 19 commands, ten editing commands.
  Successful document operations block history.
  Only two name dispatch locations:
  CommandDispatcher and ShapeFactory.
  Future: registered command / ShapeProvider factories.
end note
legend bottom
  Solid arrows: implemented dependencies / tests
  Dotted arrow: interface implementation
  Shape-specific presentation uses polymorphic descriptions.
endlegend
@enduml
